This repository contains no Freebuff source code, bundle, binary or asset.

What it ships:
  - approval-reader.css: a stylesheet written for this project.
  - tools/: small scripts that read your own installed app.asar, insert one block of
    text into electron/main.cjs, and write the archive back.
  - apply.ps1 / revert.ps1: wrappers that back up and restore your own archive.

The patch is applied by you, to your own installed copy, on your own machine. Nothing
is redistributed, and no part of the application is modified beyond the inserted block
plus the stylesheet it carries.

